# B. a take-over through the credential handoff plane raises the epoch; the new owner grants at epoch 2 under the same share (owner X, new owner Y, satellite Z; fake codex token server)

## B1 X owns the share at epoch 1 and leases it to Z
```json
{
  "owner": {
    "id": "codex-shared-example.com",
    "source": "local",
    "shareId": "732d4bc5-84fd-42e7-94ac-6b114183e746",
    "shareEpoch": 1,
    "lease": null
  },
  "z": {
    "id": "codex-shared-example.com@732d4bc5",
    "source": "leased",
    "shareId": "732d4bc5-84fd-42e7-94ac-6b114183e746",
    "shareEpoch": 1,
    "lease": {
      "shareId": "732d4bc5-84fd-42e7-94ac-6b114183e746",
      "epoch": 1,
      "authorityNodeId": "6f32c1b0-62db-42f2-a3c2-4bfa4f1431ea",
      "expiresAt": 1793991693
    }
  }
}
```

## B2 export without an epoch param: the binding carries row epoch + 1 and the share id
```json
{
  "epoch": 2,
  "shareId": "732d4bc5-84fd-42e7-94ac-6b114183e746"
}
```

## B3 after adoption: Y's row is the authority at epoch 2 under the same share; X's row is stood down
```json
{
  "y": {
    "id": "codex-shared-example.com",
    "source": "local",
    "shareId": "732d4bc5-84fd-42e7-94ac-6b114183e746",
    "shareEpoch": 2,
    "lease": null
  },
  "x": {
    "id": "codex-shared-example.com",
    "source": "local",
    "shareId": "732d4bc5-84fd-42e7-94ac-6b114183e746",
    "shareEpoch": 1,
    "lease": null,
    "status": "ok"
  }
}
```

## B4 the new owner grants at epoch 2; the old owner cannot; the satellite moves to epoch 2 and refuses the stale epoch
```json
{
  "Y grants without params": {
    "shareId": "732d4bc5-84fd-42e7-94ac-6b114183e746",
    "epoch": 2,
    "authorityNodeId": "6df16340-5dae-4b2b-aa0d-ce4acc5e078c"
  },
  "X (old owner) grants now": "credential_handoff_fenced",
  "Z installs Y's epoch-2 payload over X's epoch-1 lease": "ok",
  "Z installs X's stale epoch-1 payload again": "account_lease_conflict (retired_instance)",
  "z row": {
    "id": "codex-shared-example.com@732d4bc5",
    "source": "leased",
    "shareId": "732d4bc5-84fd-42e7-94ac-6b114183e746",
    "shareEpoch": 2,
    "lease": {
      "shareId": "732d4bc5-84fd-42e7-94ac-6b114183e746",
      "epoch": 2,
      "authorityNodeId": "6df16340-5dae-4b2b-aa0d-ce4acc5e078c",
      "expiresAt": 1793991693
    }
  }
}
```

